471	     * Counts the existing owners that already share the given first name and last name, comparing
472	     * both case-insensitively. Called before a new owner is saved, so the returned value reflects
473	     * the number of namesakes that existed prior to this create.
474	     *
475	     * @param firstName the new owner's first name
476	     * @param lastName  the new owner's last name
